  vendorName: Chemist Cornelius
  offerText: A minor financial investment for a vial of my experimental vigor tonic.
    It takes absolutely no room, and you will feel like a titan for the hour.
  acceptResultText: You drink the tonic. Your heart races, and you feel an incredible,
    pulsing energy in your veins!
  rejectResultText: You reject the suspicious chemical. You drink a glass of fresh
    water instead, feeling naturally hydrated and pleased to save your coins.
  acceptedDelayedText: The 'vigor' was merely cheap adrenaline and toxic solvents.
    You crash horribly, barely able to keep your eyes open.
  rejectedDelayedText: 
